{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-13-1","title":"Revelation 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A beast rises out of the sea with seven heads and ten horns, to whom the dragon gives his power. 11 Another beast comes out of the earth; 14 causes an image to be made of the former beast, 15 and that men should worship it, 16 and receive his mark.</p>\n<p>upon. Jer 5:22 and saw. 11:7; 17:8; Da 7:2,3 having. 12:3; 17:3,7-12,16; Da 7:7,8,19,20,23,24 ten crowns. 12:3 name. or, names. blasphemy. 5,6; 17:3,5; Da 7:25; 11:36; 2Th 2:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-2","title":"Revelation 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>was like. Jer 5:6; 13:23; Da 7:6,7; Ho 13:7; Hab 1:8 and his feet. 1Sa 17:34-37; 2Ki 2:24; Pr 17:12; 28:15; Da 7:4,5; Ho 13:8; Am 5:19 and his mouth. Ps 22:21; Isa 5:29; Ho 11:10; Am 3:12; 2Ti 4:17; 1Pe 5:8 dragon. 12:3,4,9,13,15 gave. 16:10; 17:12; 19:20; 20:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-3","title":"Revelation 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>one. 1,2,14; 17:10 wounded. Gr. slain. and his. Eze 30:24 all. 17:6,8,13,17; Lu 2:1; Joh 12:19; Ac 8:10,11,13; 2Th 2:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-4","title":"Revelation 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>And they. 2; 9:20; Ps 106:37,38; 1Co 10:20-22; 2Co 4:4 and they. 12,13,15; Da 11:36,37; 2Th 2:4 Who is like. 18:18 who is able. 17:14; De 9:2; 1Sa 17:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-5","title":"Revelation 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>a mouth. Da 7:8,11,25; 11:36 and power. 11:2,3; 12:6,14 to continue. or, to make war. 7; 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-6","title":"Revelation 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>he opened. Job 3:1; Mt 12:34; 15:19; Ro 3:13 and his. 21:3; Joh 1:14; *Gr: Col 1:19; 2:9; Heb 9:2,11,12,24 and them. 4:1,4; 5:13; 7:9; 11:12; 12:12; 18:20; 19:1-6; Heb 12:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-7","title":"Revelation 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>to make. 11:7; 12:17; Da 7:21,25; 8:24,25; 11:36-39; 12:1 and power. 10:11; 11:18; 17:15; Ex 9:16; Isa 10:15; 37:26; Jer 25:9; 27:6,7 Jer 51:20-24; Da 5:18-23; Lu 4:6; Joh 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-8","title":"Revelation 13:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>all. 3,4,14,15 whose. 3:5,20; 12:15; 21:27; Ex 32:32; Isa 4:3; Da 12:1; Lu 10:20; Php 4:3 Lamb. 5:6-9,12; Joh 1:29 from. 17:8; Eph 1:4; Tit 1:2; 1Pe 1:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-9","title":"Revelation 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>2:7,11,17,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-10","title":"Revelation 13:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>that leadeth. Ex 21:23-25; Isa 14:2; 33:1; Mt 7:2 he that killeth. 16:6; Ge 9:5,6; Isa 26:21; Mt 26:52 Here. 1:9; 2:2,19; 3:3,10; 14:12; La 3:26; Hab 2:3; Lu 18:1-8; 21:19 Col 1:11; Heb 6:12; 10:36,37; 12:3,4; Jas 1:2-4; 5:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-11","title":"Revelation 13:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>coming. 1; 11:7; 17:8 and he had. Mt 7:15; Ro 16:18; 2Co 11:13-15 and he spake. 17; 12:3,4,17; 17:6; Da 7:8,24,25; 2Th 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-12","title":"Revelation 13:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>causeth. 3,14-17; 17:10,11; 2Th 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-13","title":"Revelation 13:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he doeth. 16:14; 19:20; Ex 7:11,12,22; 8:7,18,19; 9:11; De 13:1-3; Mt 24:24 Mr 13:22; Ac 8:9-11; 2Th 2:9,10 he maketh. 11:5; Nu 16:35; 1Ki 18:38; 2Ki 1:10-14; Mt 16:1; Lu 9:54-56 2Ti 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-14","title":"Revelation 13:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>deceiveth. 12:9; 18:23; 19:20; 20:3,10; 2Ki 22:20; *marg: Job 12:16; Isa 44:20; Eze 14:9; 2Th 2:9-12 dwell. 3,8 they. 3,4,11,12,15; 14:9,11; 15:2; 16:2; 19:20; 20:4; 2Ki 20:7; Eze 8:10 Eze 16:17; Da 11:36; 2Th 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-15","title":"Revelation 13:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>life. Gr. breath. Ge 2:7; Ps 135:17; Jer 10:14; 51:17; Hab 2:19; Jas 2:26; *Gr: speak. Ps 115:5; 135:16; Jer 10:5 cause. 14; 16:2,5; 17:6,14,17; 18:20,24; 19:20; 20:4; Da 7:20,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-16","title":"Revelation 13:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>both. 11:18; 19:5,18; 20:12; 2Ch 15:13; Ps 115:13; Ac 26:22 rich. Job 34:19; Ps 49:2 free. 6:15; 19:18; 1Co 12:13; Ga 3:28; Eph 6:8; Col 3:11 receive. Gr. give them. a mark. 14:9-11; 15:2; 19:20; 20:4; Zec 13:6 or. 7:3; Ex 13:9; De 6:8; 11:18; Eze 9:4; 2Ti 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-17","title":"Revelation 13:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>mark. 16 name. 3:12; 14:11; 17:5; 22:4 the number. 18; 15:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-13-18","title":"Revelation 13:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Here. 1:3; 17:9; Ps 107:43; Da 12:10; Ho 14:9; Mr 13:14 count. 15:2 the number. 21:17; De 3:11; Ro 3:5</p>"}]}